<title>BELGIUM: Belgian liquidity little changed at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgian liquidity little changed at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian money market liquidity was little changed at the Belgian National Bank's fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances. Details -</p>
<p>    Value date Oct 2	  expiry on Oct 9</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	    9.65  bln bfr    (9.60 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate	     3.00 pct	    (3.00 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	9.65  bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted  100 pct</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on Oct 2</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
